        @param n: The integer data to be encoded to the AMF3 data stream.
        @type n: integer data
        @see: U{Parsing Integers on OSFlash
        <http://osflash.org/documentation/amf3/parsing_integers>}
        for more info.
        """
        self.stream.write(encode_int(n))
